    "ai.onboardingPrompt" : {
      "comment" : "Pasted into an AI coding assistant; keep the commands and placeholders exactly.",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please connect this Git repository to YunBox (Git LFS assets go straight to my own Tencent Cloud COS, no server needed) and install the push check.\n\nRepository: %1$@\nCurrent state: %2$@\n%3$@\n\nWork through these steps in order, reading each JSON result before deciding the next step:\n1. In the repository, run `%4$@ doctor --json` to see where things stand; for options you are unsure about, see `%5$@ init --help`.\n2. If the report is missing COS keys (the failed check titled \"COS 密钥\"): stop and ask me to run `%6$@ login` in a terminal myself, or to save them in the YunBox app's Storage panel. Do not ask me for the SecretId / SecretKey, and never put keys in command-line arguments, files or the repository.\n3. Run `%7$@ buckets --json` to list the available buckets, and confirm with me which bucket and folder prefix to use (default yunbox/<owner>/<repo>); ask me before creating a new bucket.\n4. Run `%8$@ init --bucket <name-APPID> --region <region> --prefix <prefix> --yes` (add --create for a new bucket).\n5. Run `%9$@ doctor --json` again and make sure nothing fails; if something does, apply its fixes or tell me.\n6. Run `%10$@ hook install` so pre-push checks sizes and push freezes before uploading.\n7. Ask me whether I want push freeze windows; if so, use `%11$@ freeze set \"Mo-Fr 09:00-18:00\"` (add --shared to share it with the team), then confirm with `%12$@ freeze check --json`. See `%13$@ freeze --help` for the syntax.\n8. Show me the changes to .gitattributes and .yunbox/config and let me decide whether to commit them; do not git push, and do not change existing commits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "请帮我把这个 Git 仓库接入云匣 YunBox（Git LFS 素材直传我自己的腾讯云 COS，不需要服务端），并安装推送检查。\n\n仓库：%1$@\n当前状态：%2$@\n%3$@\n\n按顺序做，每一步先读 JSON 结果再决定下一步：\n1. 在仓库目录运行 `%4$@ doctor --json` 查看现状；不清楚的选项看 `%5$@ init --help`。\n2. 如果报告缺少 COS 密钥（标题为「COS 密钥」的失败项）：停下来，请我自己在终端运行 `%6$@ login`，或在云匣客户端的「存储」面板里保存。不要向我索要 SecretId / SecretKey，也不要把密钥写进命令行参数、文件或仓库。\n3. 运行 `%7$@ buckets --json` 列出可用的 bucket，和我确认用哪个 bucket 和目录前缀（默认 yunbox/<owner>/<repo>）；需要新建 bucket 时先问我。\n4. 运行 `%8$@ init --bucket <名称-APPID> --region <地域> --prefix <前缀> --yes`（新建 bucket 再加 --create）。\n5. 再运行 `%9$@ doctor --json`，确认没有失败项；有失败项时按其中的 fixes 处理或告诉我。\n6. 运行 `%10$@ hook install`，让 pre-push 在上传前检查体积和禁推时段。\n7. 问我是否需要禁推时段；需要时用 `%11$@ freeze set \"Mo-Fr 09:00-18:00\"`（团队共享加 --shared），再用 `%12$@ freeze check --json` 核对。写法见 `%13$@ freeze --help`。\n8. 把 .gitattributes、.yunbox/config 的改动给我看，由我决定是否提交；不要 git push，也不要改动已有提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ai.onboardingPromptS3" : {
      "comment" : "Pasted into an AI coding assistant; keep the commands and placeholders exactly.",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please connect this Git repository to YunBox (Git LFS assets go straight to my own S3-compatible storage, such as Cloudflare R2, AWS S3 or MinIO, no server needed) and install the push check.\n\nRepository: %1$@\nCurrent state: %2$@\n%3$@\n\nWork through these steps in order, reading each JSON result before deciding the next step:\n1. In the repository, run `%4$@ doctor --json` to see where things stand; for options you are unsure about, see `%5$@ init --help`.\n2. If the report is missing S3 keys (the failed check titled \"S3 密钥\"), or step 4 says this machine has no S3 keys yet: stop and ask me to run `%6$@ login --provider s3` in a terminal myself, or to save them in the YunBox app's Storage panel. Do not ask me for the Access Key ID / Secret Access Key, and never put keys in command-line arguments, files or the repository.\n3. YunBox cannot list or create S3 buckets. Confirm with me which service to use (Cloudflare R2, AWS S3, MinIO or another endpoint), the private bucket I have already created in the service's console, and the folder prefix (default yunbox/<owner>/<repo>); R2 also needs the account ID. R2 tokens can be limited to buckets but not to prefixes, so one bucket per project is recommended.\n4. Run `%7$@ init --preset r2 --account-id <account ID> --bucket <name> --prefix <prefix> --yes`; for AWS S3 use `--preset aws --region <region>`, for MinIO `--preset minio --endpoint <address>`, and for other services `--provider s3 --endpoint <address> --region <region>`.\n5. Run `%8$@ doctor --json` again and make sure nothing fails; if something does, apply its fixes or tell me.\n6. Run `%9$@ hook install` so pre-push checks sizes and push freezes before uploading.\n7. Ask me whether I want push freeze windows; if so, use `%10$@ freeze set \"Mo-Fr 09:00-18:00\"` (add --shared to share it with the team), then confirm with `%11$@ freeze check --json`. See `%12$@ freeze --help` for the syntax.\n8. Show me the changes to .gitattributes and .yunbox/config and let me decide whether to commit them; do not git push, and do not change existing commits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "请帮我把这个 Git 仓库接入云匣 YunBox（Git LFS 素材直传我自己的 S3 兼容存储，例如 Cloudflare R2、AWS S3、MinIO，不需要服务端），并安装推送检查。\n\n仓库：%1$@\n当前状态：%2$@\n%3$@\n\n按顺序做，每一步先读 JSON 结果再决定下一步：\n1. 在仓库目录运行 `%4$@ doctor --json` 查看现状；不清楚的选项看 `%5$@ init --help`。\n2. 如果报告缺少 S3 密钥（标题为「S3 密钥」的失败项），或者第 4 步提示本机还没有 S3 密钥：停下来，请我自己在终端运行 `%6$@ login --provider s3`，或在云匣客户端的「存储」面板里保存。不要向我索要 Access Key ID / Secret Access Key，也不要把密钥写进命令行参数、文件或仓库。\n3. 云匣不能列出或新建 S3 的 bucket。和我确认用哪个服务（Cloudflare R2、AWS S3、MinIO 或其他 endpoint）、我已在服务控制台建好的私有 bucket，以及目录前缀（默认 yunbox/<owner>/<repo>）；R2 还需要账户 ID。R2 的 token 只能限定到 bucket，不能限定到前缀，建议每个项目一个 bucket。\n4. 运行 `%7$@ init --preset r2 --account-id <账户 ID> --bucket <名称> --prefix <前缀> --yes`；AWS S3 用 `--preset aws --region <地域>`，MinIO 用 `--preset minio --endpoint <地址>`，其他服务用 `--provider s3 --endpoint <地址> --region <地域>`。\n5. 再运行 `%8$@ doctor --json`，确认没有失败项；有失败项时按其中的 fixes 处理或告诉我。\n6. 运行 `%9$@ hook install`，让 pre-push 在上传前检查体积和禁推时段。\n7. 问我是否需要禁推时段；需要时用 `%10$@ freeze set \"Mo-Fr 09:00-18:00\"`（团队共享加 --shared），再用 `%11$@ freeze check --json` 核对。写法见 `%12$@ freeze --help`。\n8. 把 .gitattributes、.yunbox/config 的改动给我看，由我决定是否提交；不要 git push，也不要改动已有提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
