    "这个仓库使用 YunBox 服务端（lfs.url）。要改成直连 COS 或 S3 兼容存储，请在终端运行 git yunbox init --force。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This repository uses a YunBox server (lfs.url). To switch to direct COS or S3-compatible storage, run git yunbox init --force in Terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个版本不在本地：LFS 旧版本可能尚未下载，或仓库是部分克隆。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This version is not on this Mac: older LFS versions may not be downloaded, or the repository is a partial clone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些文件在规则加入之前就提交了，现在会显示为已修改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These files were committed before the rule was added and now show as modified."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些文件属于上面的素材类型，但在 Git 里是普通文件，不是 LFS 指针。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These files belong to the asset types above but are stored in Git as ordinary files, not LFS pointers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台电脑已经保存过 S3 密钥（yunbox login --provider s3）时可以留空。填写后先存进钥匙串，接入时再用它检查能否读写这个 bucket。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leave these empty if this Mac already has S3 keys saved (yunbox login --provider s3). Keys you enter are saved to the keychain first, then used to check that they can read and write this bucket."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是上次检查的结果，仓库可能已有新的提交。" : {
      "localizations" : {
